            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Uh, hi."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E09-C02-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Josie didn't leave because of me, right?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E09-C02-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "I hope not. Um, you're all moved in?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E09-C02-T07",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Yeah. Um, Alyssa Chang generously gave me back 20% of my room. Plenty of space for the nine things I still own. What's going on?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E09-C02-T08",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "Uh, Dr. Saltzman is having me test Sebastian here to see if he can stay at the school."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E09-C02-T09",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "Call if you need backup?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E09-C02-T10",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "action": "nods to Hope"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E09-C02-T11",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Sebastian",
              "version": "Sebastian"
            },
            "text": "I can assure you, I will be on my best behavior. Even a sidekick can handle me."
          },
