    {
      "id": "L-S2E09-C03",
      "title": "Sebastian tells Landon he should protect Hope.",
      "description": "During the werewolf test, Sebastian brings up that Clarke almost killed a powerless Hope.",
      "participants": [
        {
          "character": "Landon",
          "version": "Landon"
        },
        {
          "character": "Sebastian",
          "version": "Sebastian"
        }
      ],
      "subjects": [],
      "scene_type": "conversation",
      "tags": [],
      "importance": 1,
      "verified": true,
      "full": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S2E09-C03-T01",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "It's okay. Lots of vampires can't be around one werewolf, let alone this many. Most vampires can't control their emotions. Downside of all the power, I guess."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E09-C03-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Sebastian",
              "version": "Sebastian"
            },
            "text": "I think having no power would be far more concerning. You know, a little blonde birdie told me that Clarke almost killed Hope. She was powerless and running for her life, and you were... you were... you were searching for yourself?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E09-C03-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "I was trying to keep everyone safe."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E09-C03-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Sebastian",
              "version": "Sebastian"
            },
            "text": "And did it work? Mm. Not that you could have done anything anyway, of course, but if the girl that I had loved was in danger, I would want to be able to protect her."
          }
        ]
      },
      "short": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S2E09-C03-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Sebastian",
              "version": "Sebastian"
            },
            "text": "I think having no power would be far more concerning. You know, a little blonde birdie told me that Clarke almost killed Hope. She was powerless and running for her life, and you were... you were... you were searching for yourself?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E09-C03-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Landon",
              "version": "Landon"
            },
            "text": "I was trying to keep everyone safe."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E09-C03-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Sebastian",
              "version": "Sebastian"
            },
            "text": "And did it work? Mm. Not that you could have done anything anyway, of course, but if the girl that I had loved was in danger, I would want to be able to protect her."
          }
        ]
      }
