    {
      "id": "L-S2E09-C04",
      "title": "Hope tells Josie she was so jealous of her and Landon.",
      "description": "Hope confesses that when she came back from Malivore, she saw Josie and Landon happy together and was jealous to the point of being dangerous.",
      "participants": [
        {
          "character": "Hope",
          "version": "Hope"
        },
        {
          "character": "Josie",
          "version": "Josie"
        }
      ],
      "subjects": [],
      "scene_type": "conversation",
      "tags": [
        "jealous"
      ],
      "importance": 3,
      "verified": true,
      "full": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S2E09-C04-T01",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Josie",
              "version": "Josie"
            },
            "text": "Why did Clarke choose me?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E09-C04-T02",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "You're a trusting person. And you're more powerful than you know."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E09-C04-T03",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Josie",
              "version": "Josie"
            },
            "text": "I don't want to be either of those things. The second that he had me doing black magic, my head... it's like it's not mine anymore. I get upset more easily, I'm on edge. Jealous."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E09-C04-T04",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "It's not all the magic."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E09-C04-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "When I got out of Malivore, um, I came here. It was the first place I wanted to be. You guys were the first people I wanted to see. I snuck onto campus. Um... You and Landon were having movie night, or something, at the mill. I saw you..."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E09-C04-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Josie",
              "version": "Josie"
            },
            "text": "Hope."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E09-C04-T07",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "You both looked so happy. And I was so jealous. If the wrong person crossed my path in that moment, I can't imagine the damage I would have done."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E09-C04-T08",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Josie",
              "version": "Josie"
            },
            "text": "How did you move past it?"
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E09-C04-T09",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "I tried to move on. And I got a lot of that wrong, too. Obviously. But that doesn't mean we can't try again."
          }
        ]
      },
      "short": {
        "turns": [
          {
            "id": "L-S2E09-C04-T05",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "When I got out of Malivore, um, I came here. It was the first place I wanted to be. You guys were the first people I wanted to see. I snuck onto campus. Um... You and Landon were having movie night, or something, at the mill. I saw you..."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E09-C04-T06",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Josie",
              "version": "Josie"
            },
            "text": "Hope."
          },
          {
            "id": "L-S2E09-C04-T07",
            "speaker": {
              "character": "Hope",
              "version": "Hope"
            },
            "text": "You both looked so happy. And I was so jealous. If the wrong person crossed my path in that moment, I can't imagine the damage I would have done."
          }
        ]
      }
